<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine currency reserves slip to $1.82 billion.</title>
<headline>Ukraine currency reserves slip to $1.82 billion.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's gross hard currency reserves slipped to $1.82 billion dollars on April 30 from $1.85 billion dollars on March 31, the central bank said in its monthly report on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
